{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55295","headline":"贺李昉除翰林学士（题拟） · 窦仪","name":"贺李昉除翰林学士（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"廐马牵来哕哕嘶，马蹄随步蹑云梯。\n新街锦帐达三字，旧制星垣放五题。\n视草健毫从席远，受降恩诏待公批。\n仙才已在神仙地，逢见刘晨爲指迷。\n（周本淳校本《诗话总龟》卷二七引《古今诗话》。\n爲後周时作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}